# Normalise to LF in the repository. Without this, files authored on Windows
# are stored with CRLF and a Linux container gets CRLF too -- which breaks
# shell scripts and anything parsing line-by-line inside the image. The
# Dockerfile and compose file are the ones that actually bite.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never touch these: the demo database and Excel/CSV fixtures are binary,
# and "normalising" them would corrupt them.
*.db binary
*.db-shm binary
*.db-wal binary
*.xlsx binary
*.xls binary
*.png binary
